      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced. <Picture 2> and <Picture 3> supply additional views of the same subject.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic. The subject shown in <Picture 1> stands in a quiet interior, preserving the appearance, clothing and proportions established across <Picture 1>, <Picture 2> and <Picture 3>. The camera trucks right with small amplitude at slow speed while the subject turns their head toward the light. Soft directional daylight falls from a window on the left, shallow depth of field holds the background gently out of focus, and skin texture stays natural without sharpening. Colour is neutral and filmic with clean highlight roll-off.\n\noverall_soundscape: A low room tone with faint traffic beyond the glass, and the soft rustle of fabric as the subject shifts their weight.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sustained low strings at a slow tempo, widely spaced, kept well beneath the ambience.",
        864,
        480,
        124,
        "match"
      ]
